        "id": 19178,
        "name": "The Mariner",
        "username": "The_Mariner",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_mariner/{size}/2025_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-11T03:28:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welcome, all, to a <i>most thrilling spectacle!</i>&nbsp; 11 teams, representing among them <i>all the heroes of the Multiverse</i>, will face 15 battles with <i>nefarious villains</i>. &nbsp;Only time will tell who can survive this <i>devastating gauntlet</i>&nbsp;and claim <i>incredible victory!</i>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The teams are as follows:</p>\n<p>Team 1: The Harbingers- Road Warrior Mainstay, Dark Watch Expatriette, Void Guard Idealist, The Sentinels, KNYFE</p>\n<p>Team 2: The Prophets- Omnitron-X, La Comodora, Lifeline: Blood Mage</p>\n<p>Team 3: The Fateless- Malpracticd Medico, NightMist, Dark Watch Setback</p>\n<p>Team 4: The Keepers- Spirit Akash’Thryia, Legacy, Freedom Five Wraith, Heroic Luminary</p>\n<p>Team 5: The Elements- Prime Wardens Xtreme Tempest,&nbsp;Harpy, Freedom Five Absolute Zero, Haka</p>\n<p>Team 6: The Third Wheel- Ra, Fanatic, Requital Captain Cosmic</p>\n<p>Team 7: All Creatures Great And Small- Void Guard Writhe, Naturalist, Sky-Scraper</p>\n<p>Team 8: The Rebels- Supply and Demand Benchmark, Unity, Freedom Six Tachyon</p>\n<p>Team 9: The Stubble- Best of Times Chrono-Ranger, Prime Wardens Xtreme Argent Adept, Action Hero Stuntman</p>\n<p>Team 10: The Santa Clause 4: Who The Dependent Clause Is- Santa Guise, Visionary Unleashed, Bunker</p>\n<p>Team 11: The Altered States: Scholar of the Infinite, Dark Watch Mr. Fixer, Fugue State Parse</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Each team will face off in a series of 15 matches against the same villains and environments. &nbsp;The last three matches are Vengeance mode. &nbsp;In both the solo and Vengeance segments, the difficulty will increase, match by match. &nbsp;Any loss will result in elimination. &nbsp;Round 1 is Apostate at Dok’Thorath. &nbsp;Stay tuned for details, and speculate on the winners below!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:46.719Z",
